{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848920/extras/d34c27680ec99685cddb9979279dcf4e.gif?t=1772263039\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848920/extras/d34c27680ec99685cddb9979279dcf4e.poster.avif?t=1772263039\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transform this empty sanctuary into your own penguin paradise!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome penguins to your sanctuary, and tend their needs. You'll unlock new decorations as your sanctuary grows, that'll enable you to make it uniquely yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care for penguins through feeding and bathing them</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Penguins will require you to take care of them, they'll need to be bathed and fed. They might require different types of food to feel full, and a variety of bath accessories to perfect their bathing experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848920/extras/653eca4466574451ad43eae22186344b.apng?t=1772263039\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848920/extras/653eca4466574451ad43eae22186344b.poster.avif?t=1772263039\" class=\"bb_img\" width=620 height=200 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock all the unique penguins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of unique penguin outfits, which penguins will show up in, by completing sanctuary achievements.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848920?t=1772263039","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848920?t=1772263039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848920/d